EMR Data Engineering Project — Step 1: ADLS Gen2 to Azure SQL Database

1. Project Overview

This project implements a metadata-driven data ingestion pipeline using Azure Data Factory (ADF), Azure Data Lake Storage Gen2 (ADLS Gen2), and Azure SQL Database.

The source data contains EMR (Electronic Medical Records) data for two hospitals. ADF reads CSV files from ADLS Gen2 and dynamically loads them into the appropriate Azure SQL databases and tables based on metadata stored in control tables.

Current phase: ADLS Gen2 to Azure SQL Database ingestion.

Future phases: Incremental loading, SCD Type 1, SCD Type 2, auditing, restartability, monitoring, and reporting.

